<title>MEXICO: Mexico's June average crude oil prices by type.</title>
<headline>Mexico's June average crude oil prices by type.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexico's state oil and gas monopoly Petroleos Mexicanos (Pemex) updated average crude oil prices for June on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Below follows a comparative table of prices, by type and region exported, for the first fifteen days of June.</p>
<p>    Type		  June 97	     May 97</p>
<p>America</p>
<p>    Maya		    14.04		15.20</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 16.50		18.23</p>
<p>    Olmeca		  17.75		19.42</p>
<p>Europe</p>
<p>    Maya		    12.08		12.60</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 16.00		16.62</p>
<p>Far East</p>
<p>    Maya		    14.20		15.50</p>
<p>    Isthmus		 17.90		19.30</p>
<p>Africa</p>
<p>    Maya			n/a		14.53</p>
<p>    Isthmus		   n/a		18.14</p>
<p>    Olmeca		    n/a		19.23</p>
<p>Geographical Distribution</p>
<p>    United States			   78   pct</p>
<p>    Spain					7.3 pct</p>
<p>    Other America			    8   pct</p>
<p>    Far East				   3.4 pct</p>
<p>    Other Europe			     3   pct</p>
<p>    Africa				     0.3 pct</p>
<p>((--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903. E-mail at timna.tanners@reuters.com))</p>
